{"title": "Impenetrable Shadow", "pageid": 32631, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Impenetrable_Shadow", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Impenetrable Shadow</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\">Viconia DeVir</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If Viconia ends her turn in darkness, she receives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary of Loss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)\">Sanctuary of Loss</a>. \n</p><p>Viconia can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heartwrench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\">Heartwrench</a> and still keep this protection.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715004058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 924/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5941/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2673/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643670/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.618      1 -total\n 98.92%   30.287      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 44.38%   13.588      1 Template:Cond\n 34.51%   10.566      2 Template:Icon_link\n 33.21%   10.167      2 Template:Icon_text\n 30.94%    9.473      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 28.77%    8.809      4 Template:Trim\n 23.33%    7.144      2 Template:Ifempty\n 11.55%    3.537      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.61%    3.249      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32631-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715004058 and revision id 180340. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}